      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 23 tablets of the same presentation with 8.9 days on hand at current use.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 14 tablets of 300 mg from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the transfer Corvale General would retain about two weeks of supply and Corvale Lakeside would reach approximately 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
